##### LeafLift  
*solo / duo* 

Deep-flow NFT gullies maintain a 1–2 mm nutrient film beneath a crystal-clear PureLight™ lid. Variable laminar pumps slow at night, saving energy while lettuce roots stay oxygen-rich.

###### Crop Categories & Cultivars  
Leafy greens – all 12 Balcony cultivars  

